### Redesign Slice 2: Delivery planning card and delivered state

#### Files Changed
1. **[DeliveryPlanningCard.kt](file:///Users/sherifgamalradwan/anc-emr-android-native/app/src/main/java/com/sherifradwan/ancnative/ui/patienthub/components/DeliveryPlanningCard.kt)**
   - Rewrote using canonical `RecordSectionCard` with `family = FieldFamilies.delivery()`.
   - Rendered the action button using `SectionTextAction` tagged with `editDeliveryPlan` when `canEdit` is true (hidden when false).
   - Rendered `DeliveredSummary(patient)` when `patient.delivered` is true.
   - Rendered the four full-width fields with `LabeledValue`: `deliveryHospital` (`delivery_hospital_label`), `deliveryFees` (`delivery_fees_label`), `deliveryPlan` (`delivery_plan_label`), and `deliveryPostpartum` (`delivery_postpartum_label`). Missing values default to "Not recorded".
   - Removed deprecated `Card` container, date icon, pencil icon button, and uppercase headers.

2. **[DeliveryOutcomeUi.kt](file:///Users/sherifgamalradwan/anc-emr-android-native/app/src/main/java/com/sherifradwan/ancnative/ui/patienthub/components/DeliveryOutcomeUi.kt)**
   - Extracted shared private `parseDeliveryDate(date: String?): LocalDate?` used by both `deliveredHeadline` and `deliveredDateText`.
   - Added `@Composable fun deliveredDateText(date: String?): String?` formatting known dates as `"dd MMM yyyy, [N days ago]"` or `null` when unknown.
   - Restyled `DeliveredSummary` using `StatusTag(StatusKind.Delivered)` and a prominent `LabeledValue` with `testTag("deliveredHeadline")` (falling back to `"???"` via `delivery_date_unknown_value` in missing style when date is null).
   - Displayed `mode` (`deliveredMode`) and `result` (`deliveredResult`) only when recorded; placed in equal-height `LabeledValueRow` when both are present.

3. **[ClinicalBadges.kt](file:///Users/sherifgamalradwan/anc-emr-android-native/app/src/main/java/com/sherifradwan/ancnative/ui/ClinicalBadges.kt)**
   - Deleted unused `enum class DeliveryTone`, `ToneColors`, `DeliveryTone.colors()`, and `DeliverySectionBox`.
   - Removed unused `FontStyle` import.

4. **[Theme.kt](file:///Users/sherifgamalradwan/anc-emr-android-native/app/src/main/java/com/sherifradwan/ancnative/ui/Theme.kt)**
   - Deleted the 24 deprecated `Delivery*` color tokens (light and dark `Hospital`, `Fee`, `Plan`, and `Postpartum` tokens for `Bg`, `Border`, and `Text`).

5. **[strings.xml](file:///Users/sherifgamalradwan/anc-emr-android-native/app/src/main/res/values/strings.xml)**
   - Updated `delivery_planning` to `"Delivery planning &amp; outcome"`.
   - Appended the 6 new display strings before `</resources>`:
     - `delivery_hospital_label`: `"Agreed delivery hospital"`
     - `delivery_fees_label`: `"Agreed delivery fees"`
     - `delivery_plan_label`: `"Delivery plan"`
     - `delivery_postpartum_label`: `"Postpartum note"`
     - `delivery_date_label`: `"Delivery date"`
     - `delivery_date_unknown_value`: `"???"`

#### Anything Not Done
- None. All requirements and deliverables in `docs/designs/redesign/slice_02_delivery.md` have been fully and exactly implemented. No test files or protected files were touched, and no git, gradle, or network operations were run.
